shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"hK59rATCI9o_rmeQu57RWw","review_id":"MhkKgCDatJdnkhBwmehCuA","date":"2014-04-14T13:29:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9541410803794861,"text_excerpt":"This is quite an adorable, small space. I got some of the best iced coffee I've had and I was looking at the crepe menu and decided that my mother and I could split a crepe. We'd had a huge brunch but that was at 10 and it was almost 2, so split a crepe we did. It was very good. The crepe was so eggy and fluffy and perfectly cooked! We got the spinach, mushroom, and cheese. It was pretty large, too. The bathroom is upstairs in a little loft-type area they have. They also have a very nice, opulent-looking alcove, nook, thing up there. Very cool as is their fresco. I will definitely look them up when I'm in the French Quarter."},{"business_id":"hK59rATCI9o_rmeQu57RWw","review_id":"DovyRknUNW-me-ATzrYoRg","date":"2014-08-28T16:51:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9423949122428894,"text_excerpt":"I love this place! My wife chose to come here and we took the street cars over. The crepes were awesome! my wife got the Lucy which is the sweet kind with strawberries and amaretto custard. It was delicious! I opted for the ABC. it was a savory crepe with apples, bacon and cheese. that was delicious as well. We had an order of the red eye coffe and strawberry lemonade and both were top notch! We would both return and highly recommend!"},{"business_id":"hK59rATCI9o_rmeQu57RWw","review_id":"kjEoE_u3CahQi-RuMmKpww","date":"2014-11-29T19:39:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9405329823493958,"text_excerpt":"Such a cool place. If you sit in the tiny loft upstairs they will air lift your food to you with their cute little dumwaiter (have no idea how to spell that but it's a little pully elevator thing just big enough for a couple of crepe baskets). Anyway, I had the Philly Steak crepe. Delicious! They cut the beef thin enough so it was easy to chew and it was super cheesy, like a real Philly Cheese Steak only wrapped up in a soft crepe. This is a tiny spot in a perfect place for people watching. I'll be back for a sweet crepe soon!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"hK59rATCI9o_rmeQu57RWw","photo_id":"ng2Yw51U_EX6CwoaHZ814w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ng2Yw51U_EX6CwoaHZ814w.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
